WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:05.040
Your favorite superhero may be able to deflect&nbsp;
bullets, but can they draw in the energy from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.880
every living creature on earth, fuse&nbsp;
it all into a giant ball of energy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:12.880
and chuck it at a bubblegum-colored maniac&nbsp;
threatening to destroy our entire planet?

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:18.240
The moment you feel certain about your grasp of&nbsp;
power levels in Dragon Ball, prepare to have that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.880
certainty slip through your fingers as each&nbsp;
character continues their ascension to glory.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:28.080
Whether it be stepping into the hyperbolic time&nbsp;
chamber for a few days to train for a few years&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.560
or a synchronized dance with a companion&nbsp;
to merge into a more powerful super-being,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.040
each new development in the series has shown that&nbsp;
there are countless ways to amplify power levels.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:42.480
Over 30 years of lore has created plenty&nbsp;
of ammo for each side of any argument.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:44.800
For that reason, let's narrow things down a bit.

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.600
There are many powerful characters throughout&nbsp;
the show, but we want to stick with the best of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:54.720
the best - to a point. It's understandable&nbsp;
that we would leave Zeno, the Omni-King,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:00.320
off the list. Not only because he doesn't fight,&nbsp;
but also because the supreme ruler of the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:06.080
multiverse who can blink gods, mortals, and an&nbsp;
entire universe out of existence in an instant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:10.880
would make for a boring anti-climactic&nbsp;
finish to an otherwise juicy debate.

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:16.240
Dragon Ball Super contains major players from&nbsp;
across an expansive multiverse, but a majority&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.680
of the series takes place in Universe 7, where&nbsp;
the Z Fighters reside on Earth. Other universes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:27.520
are home to powerful warriors as well, such as the&nbsp;
Pride Troopers of Universe 11. Excluding numerous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:32.720
fusions and reducing any transformations to their&nbsp;
core character has resulted in this completely&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:39.840
comprehensive list that will in no way enrage&nbsp;
any fans of the phenomenal anime series. Onward!

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:45.600
New villains crop up in Dragon Ball Z with every&nbsp;
new arc. Each confrontation forces our heroes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:50.560
push themselves beyond known limits, to the point&nbsp;
that some characters have become nigh-godlike in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:55.200
power. But there is one being whose immense&nbsp;
power challenges even the strongest fighters:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.840 --> 00:02:01.840
Cell. This bio-android has spent years&nbsp;
obliterating every opponent thrown at him. He's so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:06.640
powerful that writers had to introduce different&nbsp;
timelines in order for him to be defeated.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:12.000
Even then, he manages to take control of time and&nbsp;
travel backwards, to make himself even stronger.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:17.840
Cell was created by a supercomputer using cells&nbsp;
from some of the universe's strongest heroes.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:21.440
He is able to increase his power by&nbsp;
draining energy from other entities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:25.360
which is why he roams the Earth, drinking&nbsp;
up the life forces of entire cities.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:31.600
"I owe it all to this worthless planet for&nbsp;
providing me with the bio extract I needed."

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:38.720
Cell is, without question, one of the strongest&nbsp;
life forms in existence. The only reason for him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:43.840
being at the bottom of this list is because of his&nbsp;
recent absence from the Dragon Ball Z storyline.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:47.840
Fans haven't seen Cell since GT, when he&nbsp;
is briefly allied with another villain&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:53.360
and defeated by Goku, but GT isn't considered&nbsp;
part of the canon. Cell's power has not grown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:58.880
in quite some time but given his uniquely adaptive&nbsp;
powers, he shouldn't ever be counted out for good.

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.640
This lean, green, fighting&nbsp;
machine originally trained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:05.520
to become one of the Supreme Kais of Universe 10.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:09.440
"This is my apprentice the&nbsp;
Supreme Kai in training, Zamasu."

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.520
"It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance."

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:17.440
He is well respected among the other Kais for&nbsp;
his superior intellect and massive knowledge base&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:22.960
— plus, he can brew a mean cup of tea. Now, you&nbsp;
might disagree with Zamasu's ranking on this list,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:28.240
but remember: We are talking about the characters'&nbsp;
core forms. All the scenarios that lead to Zamasu&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:33.280
becoming insanely unbeatable are created by&nbsp;
his Dragon Ball wish. Plus, things don't get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:38.720
completely out of hand until he merges with Goku&nbsp;
Black. Things get so nuts, Zeno the Omni-King&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:43.600
has to literally wipe the entire universe in&nbsp;
order to cancel out Zamasu's invincibility.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:49.120
Zamasu's misguided sense of universal&nbsp;
justice is the most imposing thing about him:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:53.440
He views humanity as detrimental to&nbsp;
existence, and seeks to wipe it out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:58.080
His Dragon Ball wish for immortality, plus&nbsp;
his merging with Goku Black, transform him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:04.960
into a massive ethereal entity which envelops the&nbsp;
universe. Yet at his core, Zamasu isn't too tough.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:10.240
Goku easily defeats Zamasu in combat in his base&nbsp;
form, and Trunks later slices him in half by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:16.000
embodying all of humanity in his sword. Granted,&nbsp;
that slice unleashes an unbeatable cosmic being&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:21.120
that begins raining destruction on the entire&nbsp;
fabric of reality. But hey, we say he cheated.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.680
It might be the way his soothing&nbsp;
lavender hair flaps in the wind.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.880
It may be his stylish jean&nbsp;
jacket. Whatever the reason,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.880 --> 00:04:34.400
Trunks has been a fan favorite for decades. He&nbsp;
first appears as a mysterious young boy capable of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:39.920
transforming into a Super Saiyan. We later learn&nbsp;
that he is the offspring of Vegeta and Bulma -

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:41.840
"She's my mom."

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.402
"WWOOOOAHHH!! So Vegeta and Bulma?!"

00:04:45.402 --> 00:04:50.000
- and has traversed several timelines&nbsp;
before settling into the one we know today.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:54.000
His father's cocky, arrogant demeanor&nbsp;
is tempered by his mother's humanity,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:56.240
resulting in a cool, level-headed warrior.

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.600
Ranking Trunks' power level is complicated,&nbsp;
given his time-traveling nature. We've seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:06.160
Future Trunks achieve greatness, but the main&nbsp;
storyline currently features Trunks as a young,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:10.720
playful kid. He also tends to implement a&nbsp;
right-place-right-time fighting technique&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.720 --> 00:05:15.040
that dazzles, but doesn't display much&nbsp;
sustainability. The promise of Future&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:20.720
Trunks places him on a pedestal among fans — one&nbsp;
he deserves. But all these competing factors make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:26.480
us reluctant to place him anywhere but just&nbsp;
below legendary status. Trunks is no slouch:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:31.600
He has helped the gang defeat Cell, beat the tar&nbsp;
out of Frieza, and sliced an immortal in half.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:36.400
Trunks is entirely worthy of the praise he&nbsp;
receives. But we're still waiting for more.

00:05:37.360 --> 00:05:42.560
The Tournament of Power mashes several universes&nbsp;
together. Among those are the Saiyans of Universe&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:47.600
6, where Kale is their version of the legendary&nbsp;
Super Saiyan. Kale shows up at the Tournament&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:53.360
of Power as a meek, timid fighter paired with&nbsp;
her mentor, Caulifla. After Goku enrages her,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:58.560
Kale reveals her true power by transforming&nbsp;
into the legendary Super Saiyan. Kale is so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:03.840
powerful that she marches unharmed through a&nbsp;
kamehameha attack from Super Saiyan Blue Goku,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:08.320
and then unleashes a barrage of uncontrolled&nbsp;
energy blasts at everyone in the vicinity.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:14.800
Much like her Universe 7 counterpart Broly,&nbsp;
Kale's base power level is seemingly limitless.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:18.640
The downside to this genetic trait is&nbsp;
that her form is a berserker state,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:23.760
rooted in rage and difficult to control.&nbsp;
The normally docile Kale has yet to undergo&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.760 --> 00:06:29.040
the years of training we've seen other heroes go&nbsp;
through, so as of right now, Kale is all promise.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:33.280
She hasn't had enough time for her character&nbsp;
to develop, but we'll likely see Kale rise&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:38.200
through the ranks to become one of the strongest&nbsp;
characters in all of the Dragon Ball franchise.

00:06:39.200 --> 00:06:43.760
For a long time, Broly technically wasn't&nbsp;
considered part of the Dragon Ball canon.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:47.840
Thankfully, fans latched on to their&nbsp;
favorite rage monster and never let go.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:54.320
In 2018, Dragon Ball Super: Broly was released,&nbsp;
officially bringing this outrageously strong&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:59.760
character into the canon. Broly was born in&nbsp;
a pod next to Goku on the Saiyan home planet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.760 --> 00:07:05.280
His power was so great that it scared King&nbsp;
Vegeta, who ordered Broly and his father executed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:10.240
This decision stoked the primal fury now&nbsp;
synonymous with his legendary bloodline.

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:14.480
Broly's tragic path in life leaves him&nbsp;
devoid of any appropriate training for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.480 --> 00:07:19.840
his immense power. When faced with challenges,&nbsp;
Broly simply calls forth more power and bashes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:25.120
the problem in with his fists. His story is&nbsp;
left open-ended in Dragon Ball Super: Broly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.120 --> 00:07:28.960
implying we have yet to see just&nbsp;
how strong Broly can truly become.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:34.160
Some may think Broly should be much higher&nbsp;
on this list, but he lacks adaptability.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:40.080
He may be a bottomless pit of raw power, but&nbsp;
he's just not honed. Still, it's a bit scary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:44.480
to imagine what he might be capable of, given&nbsp;
the proper training and some caring friends.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.120
"There's plenty of stuff I wanna&nbsp;
teach him too if he's interested."

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:49.760
Majin Buu

00:07:55.600 --> 00:08:00.320
pink mass possesses a unique ability to turn&nbsp;
his enemies into chocolate and absorb their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.320 --> 00:08:05.840
power by eating them — adding a layer of terror&nbsp;
icing to an extremely unpredictable villain.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:10.080
Majin Buu was created by a warlock many&nbsp;
years before the main characters were born;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:15.280
upon release from his imprisonment, he showed that&nbsp;
there is no controlling his childlike emotions.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:19.120
His lack of control adds many challenges&nbsp;
to an already formidable enemy.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:24.560
No other character in all of Dragon Ball has shown&nbsp;
as many different forms and transformations as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:30.000
Majin Buu, morphing numerous times based on&nbsp;
his emotional responses and eating habits.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.360
Though his regenerative ability combines with his&nbsp;
power level to create a seemingly unbeatable foe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:41.360
Buu is a slave to his emotions. Ego and reason&nbsp;
play second fiddle to his reactive persona,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:46.320
resulting in a lack of technique and passion&nbsp;
needed to rise up against new challenges.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:51.720
It is for this reason that such an impregnable&nbsp;
character finds himself at the bottom of the list.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:56.240
It goes without saying that the son of&nbsp;
the first Super Saiyan would inherit a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:01.360
solid amount of power through genetics alone.&nbsp;
Gohan has shown time and again in moments of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:01.360 --> 00:09:05.440
crisis that there is an immense amount&nbsp;
of power lying inside his docile heart.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:10.640
His strongest aspects shine through in his&nbsp;
protective instincts, drawing power from a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.640 --> 00:09:16.240
limitless well of energy when seeing his loved&nbsp;
ones in danger. At times he displays a power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:22.000
beyond that of Super Saiyan, surpassing even&nbsp;
Goku. It is Gohan who, while not delivering&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.000 --> 00:09:27.280
the final blow, ultimately defeats the bio-android&nbsp;
Cell when the rest of Earth's heroes have fallen.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:33.200
Despite all that power, Gohan's Saiyan fighting&nbsp;
instincts are tempered by some of his more human&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:38.320
attributes. The desire to fight and grow stronger&nbsp;
are of little interest to this gentle soldier.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.880 --> 00:09:43.120
His interests lie in raising a family and&nbsp;
studying to become a renowned scholar.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.760 --> 00:09:48.400
With training and a drive to surpass his&nbsp;
competitors, there is no doubt that Gohan could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:54.400
become a fighter of extremely potent power and&nbsp;
prestige. Alas, his preference for a simple life&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:58.880
lowers this member of the endangered Saiyan&nbsp;
race down near the bottom of the list.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:03.440
"Oh sorry I didn't ask, are you more of a&nbsp;
vanilla guy? If so then take this one, I'm easy."

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:05.520
"No it's not a problem, chocolate's fine."

00:10:05.520 --> 00:10:07.200
"I'm a softy for soft serve!"

00:10:07.200 --> 00:10:07.840
"Uh, yeah."

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:13.520
This stoic assassin emerged as a fierce competitor&nbsp;
in his battle with Goku in the Tournament of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:19.360
Power. Known among Universe 6 as the "Legendary&nbsp;
Assassin," Hit possesses an extremely unique and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:24.800
powerful ability in Time-Skip — which allows him&nbsp;
to manipulate time and skip forward a tenth of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:30.080
a second, which is hugely significant once you&nbsp;
move as fast as the characters on this list do.

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:33.360
Hit combines his Time-Skip&nbsp;
ability with his Phoenix Eye Fist&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:37.520
to focus his attacks into one point&nbsp;
and aim at his opponents vital organs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:42.240
Given that the trenchcoat-clad hitman&nbsp;
is also over a thousand years old,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:42.240 --> 00:10:47.760
he also has a vast amount of experience. He can&nbsp;
rapidly adapt to his fighting situation, shown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:52.800
in his ability to improve his Time-Skip for even&nbsp;
larger chunks of time in his fight against Goku.

00:10:53.360 --> 00:10:56.880
"Somehow he's figured out how to improve his&nbsp;
fighting move in the middle of this match,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.480
without any boost to his power!"

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:04.000
While his rare ability allows for a large&nbsp;
advantage, once his opponents study his moves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:07.200
they're able to predict where he'll&nbsp;
go next and defend appropriately.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.640
This leaves something lacking in this&nbsp;
incredible fighter's raw base power.

00:11:12.640 --> 00:11:18.080
The primary antagonist in the Dragon Ball&nbsp;
series, Frieza, appears multiple times as Goku's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:23.440
arch-nemesis. He plays a major part in the Saiyan&nbsp;
timeline as the character responsible for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:28.480
destruction of their homeworld, the obliteration&nbsp;
of the planet Namek, personally killing Vegeta's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:33.840
father, and has led multiple invasions of&nbsp;
Earth. The Emperor of Universe 7 possesses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:40.000
an incredible knack for drawing upon vast amounts&nbsp;
of energy. His strongest, original form is buried&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:44.800
beneath a series of transformations in order&nbsp;
to help his body contain his incredible might.

00:11:45.360 --> 00:11:49.440
Frieza is extremely hard to kill and&nbsp;
is so talented as a fighter that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:52.800
achieved his Golden form with&nbsp;
only four months of training.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:57.760
His power is second only to his enormous&nbsp;
ego, which is damaged so badly by his defeat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.760 --> 00:12:01.520
to Goku that it takes him years of mental&nbsp;
training for him to regain his strength.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:09.840
The mark of a true villain shines through in&nbsp;
Frieza's cruelty via torture and genocide.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:12.560
"What's he thinking? No! The Frieza Force!"

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:16.560
"Did he really wipe out his&nbsp;
entire army just to make a point?"

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:21.120
Should this tyrant be able to temper his&nbsp;
arrogance and psychopathic tendencies,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:24.520
he will no doubt rival the&nbsp;
universe's strongest heroes.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:30.640
The Pride Troopers of Universe 11 are&nbsp;
led by the husky warrior known as Toppo.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:35.920
Despite his rotund stature, the candidate for&nbsp;
the next God of Destruction is deceptively fast&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:41.280
and shrouds all his actions in an extra-thick&nbsp;
layer of justice. His specialties in battle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:47.120
lie not only in his energy blasts, but in close&nbsp;
quarter combat via debilitating locks and holds.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:51.760
While his base power level is already&nbsp;
crazy strong, once his energy surges,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:57.680
displayed by a menacing purple aura, it reveals&nbsp;
Toppo's true power — enabling an easy victory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:02.080
of Frieza's golden form. While usually&nbsp;
displaying respect to his fellow fighters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:06.960
he also has a bit of a temper which can disrupt&nbsp;
his normally level-headed fighting style.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:11.200
Desperation causes Toppo to abandon his&nbsp;
principles in the pursuit of victory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:14.440
which ultimately leads to his&nbsp;
defeat at the hands of Vegeta.

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:20.000
An infinite supply of anger courses&nbsp;
through the Saiyan bloodline in the form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.000 --> 00:13:24.240
of Prince Vegeta. Originally destined&nbsp;
to rule his doomed home planet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:28.400
the reluctant anti-hero's power levels&nbsp;
always seem to be just a step behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:32.160
Earth's strongest — occasionally crossing&nbsp;
into the mightiest of the Dragon Ball&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:37.600
pantheon through displays of pure rage. Few&nbsp;
are liked by the sardonic warrior prince&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:43.440
and even fewer are as dedicated to the achievement&nbsp;
of ultimate power. Vegeta's dedication to martial&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:48.720
arts and the cultivation of his ki [CHEE] are&nbsp;
unparalleled. Combined with his regal bloodline,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.560
these characteristics make for one of the&nbsp;
most dominant fighters in the universe.

00:13:53.120 --> 00:13:58.480
While he repeatedly says Goku is his mortal enemy,&nbsp;
his actions show respect and acknowledgement in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:03.200
the competitive drive supplied by his Saiyan&nbsp;
companion. Once sent to Earth in the form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:07.840
of an enemy in search of the dragon balls, his&nbsp;
disdain for "Kakarot" [KAK-are-rot] is pacified&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:12.800
by his desire to pass him in terms of power.&nbsp;
He repeatedly falls short in this endeavor as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:12.800 --> 00:14:18.000
his anger tends to overwhelm him and cause him to&nbsp;
rush into dangerous situations without analysis.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:18.800 --> 00:14:22.320
An extraordinarily high opinion&nbsp;
of himself results in Vegeta&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:22.320 --> 00:14:27.600
underestimating his opponents and charging in&nbsp;
ill-prepared. His immense amount of pride calls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:32.800
forth endless pools of power and at other&nbsp;
times serves as a debilitating weakness.

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:36.880
"I don't care how powerful you are -&nbsp;
I will be the one who defeats you and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:36.880 --> 00:14:38.640
claims the super dragon balls!"

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.560
Regardless, he continues to be one&nbsp;
of Universe 7's strongest heroes.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:49.600
The backstory of this stoic fighter&nbsp;
is wrought with death and loneliness.

00:14:49.600 --> 00:14:51.600
"Jiren hasn't moved a muscle yet."

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:55.840
"Yeah, nor would I expect him to. That's&nbsp;
kind of his schtick, the whole stoic thing."

00:14:56.640 --> 00:15:01.680
As a child, Jiren lost his parents and his&nbsp;
entire village to a villainous demon who,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:01.680 --> 00:15:04.400
in a later confrontation, also killed his master.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:09.920
This resulted in a lifetime of dedication&nbsp;
to strength and honor and until he joined&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:09.920 --> 00:15:14.400
the Pride Soldiers, Jiren spent a large&nbsp;
portion of his life alone in his training.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:20.000
The most impressive aspect of this burly fighter&nbsp;
lies not in transformation, but in the ability to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:27.520
sustain his energy levels through incredible&nbsp;
displays of strength and endurance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:32.000
He is viewed as the most powerful warrior&nbsp;
in Universe 11 and is the only mortal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:34.080
capable of defeating their God of Destruction.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:38.000
In one of the most climactic&nbsp;
moments in Dragon Ball Super,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:44.240
Goku transforms into his most powerful form yet,&nbsp;
Ultra Instinct. But even in this ultimate form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:49.120
Jiren simply draws forth even more energy to&nbsp;
continue battling toe-to-toe with the Saiyan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:54.000
Most of the fighters in the universe use&nbsp;
transformations to temporarily multiply their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:57.040
power beyond what is normally&nbsp;
sustainable for their bodies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:02.720
Jiren employs a mostly defensive style that&nbsp;
forces his opponents to exhaust themselves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:08.240
allowing for his attacks to land with devastating&nbsp;
results. While Jiren possesses a herculean amount&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:12.800
of power, his life has resulted in an almost&nbsp;
cold disposition that leaves no room for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:12.800 --> 00:16:18.040
emotion — which happens to be the greatest source&nbsp;
of strength for the series' primary protagonist.

00:16:19.040 --> 00:16:23.840
The Dragon Ball series begins with Goku as&nbsp;
a child teaming up with Bulma in a hunt for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:29.280
the mythical Dragon Balls. All these years later,&nbsp;
the loveable defender of Earth continues to grow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:35.040
in strength while maintaining a gentle disposition&nbsp;
that seems to disarm even the Gods of Destruction.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:35.040 --> 00:16:40.560
Seemingly devoid of any negative emotions, Goku&nbsp;
has ambitions that stem from his desire to protect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:45.760
those he loves. It is in moments of despair, when&nbsp;
his loss in battle would spell death for those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:51.280
around him, that the Saiyan draws forth epic&nbsp;
new levels of power to overwhelm his enemies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:55.600
Whether it be through his signature move&nbsp;
the Kamehameha, or by channeling ki from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:55.600 --> 00:17:01.440
nearby lifeforms to form the almighty Spirit&nbsp;
Bomb, the admirable hero always finds a way.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:06.480
Goku was met with another moment of desperation&nbsp;
in the final minutes of the Tournament of Power.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:06.480 --> 00:17:10.000
With the losers of the tournament facing&nbsp;
the destruction of their universe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:14.640
our favorite Saiyan displays a fighting&nbsp;
form normally reserved for the gods in Ultra&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:19.920
Instinct — a transformation in which the mind&nbsp;
separates from the body, leaving it to operate on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:25.920
pure instinct. Though others may seem stronger at&nbsp;
first, Goku has shown us repeatedly that few can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:31.080
match the limitless well of energy that flows&nbsp;
through the cheery protector of Universe 7.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:36.160
This catlike humanoid shows a level of&nbsp;
indifference to most lifeforms that could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:41.040
only be reserved for an entity of cosmic&nbsp;
power. Beerus seems to harbor no ill will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:41.040 --> 00:17:45.680
towards any lifeforms, merely annoyance at&nbsp;
any disruptions in his favorite activities,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:49.760
acting mostly as a mechanism of&nbsp;
nature. As a God of Destruction,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:54.400
he is served with the duty of maintaining balance&nbsp;
in Universe 7, which he enacts through the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:54.400 --> 00:18:00.640
decimation of any planet that displease him. The&nbsp;
imposing entity has existed for millions of years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:04.800
which adds quite a bit of experience to&nbsp;
the gourmet-loving god's remarkable power.

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:10.400
While Goku seems to be evenly matched with him at&nbsp;
certain points, it is apparent that Beerus did not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:16.240
come close to unleashing his full potential. He is&nbsp;
able to nullify the energy of most mortals and can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:16.240 --> 00:18:20.480
launch devastating attacks with his Sphere&nbsp;
of Destruction and has a base power level&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:20.480 --> 00:18:26.400
which needs no transformation or amplification.&nbsp;
Most mortals cower before his fickle appetites,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:26.400 --> 00:18:30.760
but there is someone who quite literally&nbsp;
schools him in terms of strength and technique.

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:36.720
When we first meet this lean, aloof individual,&nbsp;
it is not readily apparent that great power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:36.720 --> 00:18:42.080
lies behind his carefree smile. While Beerus&nbsp;
zips around the universe imposing his will on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:42.080 --> 00:18:46.880
anyone who dares annoy him, Whis stands by&nbsp;
his side — appearing as no more than a gentle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:46.880 --> 00:18:52.560
companion, complacent in running trivial errands.&nbsp;
As the story unwinds, it becomes clearer that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:58.880
immortal angel possesses an unfathomable amount&nbsp;
of power. When Beerus begins destroying worlds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:04.480
after consuming wasabi, Whis knocks him out with&nbsp;
a single chop to the neck. In Dragon Ball Super,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:10.160
he appears to exert little effort in a sparring&nbsp;
session against both Goku and Vegeta, even going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:14.720
as far as autographing the unwitting Saiyan's&nbsp;
outfits in the middle of their dual onslaught.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:20.640
Whis has the ability to rewind time up to&nbsp;
three minutes without creating any paradoxes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:25.840
or time loops — a necessary power when one's sole&nbsp;
responsibility is to mitigate the powers of a God&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:31.360
of Destruction. Despite all these abilities,&nbsp;
his effortless displays of speed and strength&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:34.880
come paired with a penchant for table&nbsp;
manners and a love of Earth cuisine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:38.720
There is no other being in&nbsp;
Universe 7 with as much power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:43.840
which makes his serene disposition all the more&nbsp;
sensible. What need is there for any displays of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:43.840 --> 00:19:48.720
anxiety or negative emotion when nothing in your&nbsp;
realm of existence is capable of causing you harm?

